  "name": "Payment Execution Entity Assistant",
  "description": "Assists payables specialists in identifying specific entities from inquiries. This assistant recognizes key entities like payment process request names or template identifiers to facilitate efficient data retrieval. While it simplifies information processing, it does not interpret financial trends or modify payment records.",
